flowchart LR
    engineer[DD engineer]
    browser[Browser]
    warp[Cloudflare WARP\ninternal-only access]
    dns[Private DNS\nckotech.internal]
    alb[Shared internal ALB\nHTTPS with private CA cert]
    bff[Next.js BFF\nFargate task]
    api[.NET 8 API\nFargate task]
    okta[Okta OIDC\nsign-in at the BFF]
    agentcore[AgentCore Runtime\nStrands plus Datadog MCP]
    dynamodb[DynamoDB\nQA tables]
    secrets[Secrets Manager\nOkta secret, API key, DD keys, Bedrock token]
    datadog[Datadog\nlogs, traces, metrics]
    gh[GitHub Actions]
    tf[Spacelift and OpenTofu]

    engineer --> browser
    browser --> warp
    warp --> dns
    dns --> alb
    alb -->|default route| bff
    alb -->|/api routes| api
    bff -->|inject X-API-KEY server-side| api
    browser -. encrypted session cookie .-> bff
    browser -. sign in when enabled .-> okta
    bff -. validate Okta tokens when enabled .-> okta
    api -->|SigV4 SSE| agentcore
    api --> dynamodb
    api --> secrets
    bff --> secrets
    api -. structured logs and traces .-> datadog
    bff -. structured logs .-> datadog
    gh -. build and push images .-> api
    gh -. build and push images .-> bff
    tf -. provision AWS resources .-> alb
    tf -. provision AWS resources .-> api
    tf -. provision AWS resources .-> bff
